    REFUSE "s 16(2) does not say when a proclamation takes effect if it is not dated the day its issue was authorized"

-- src:32 | (5) Every regulation of a class that is exempted from the application of the Regulations Act or to which that Act does not apply and that is not expressed to come into force on a particular day comes into force the day the regulation was enacted.
@ref Interpretation Act (BC) s 3(5) (src:32)
